## Next.js

Next.js code also follows the React section; where the two conflict, the rules in this section win. The rules in this section cover the App Router; where Next.js versions differ (`proxy.ts` or `middleware.ts`, `"use cache"` or `fetch` cache options), follow what the project uses.

