### Next.js-Names

- Keep the names the framework reads as it defines them, whatever the project's file and function naming: route files (`page`, `layout`, `route`) and their exports (`GET`, `POST`, `generateMetadata`, `generateStaticParams`).
<!-- Project-specific / Next.js-Names -->

### Next.js-Packages

- Mark every module of server-only code with `import "server-only"`, so importing it into a Client Component fails the build.
